# Beads (bd) issue tracker — local-only working space.
# Canonical issue specs live in .planning/REQUIREMENTS.md cross-referenced
# by their bd ID (e.g. cing-938). The Dolt backend keeps history in
# .beads/dolt/ which is gitignored by Beads itself; the wrapper folder
# is gitignored here so untracked files don't accumulate.
.beads/
AGENTS.md
